---Object representing any Kubernetes overrides to a job definition that's used in a SubmitJob API operation.
---@class aws.batch.EksContainerOverride
---@field name? aws.batch.String A pointer to the container that you want to override. The name must match a unique container name that you wish to override.
---@field image? aws.batch.String The override of the Docker image that's used to start the container.
