---@field mountPath? aws.batch.String The path on the container where the volume is mounted.
---@field subPath? aws.batch.String A sub-path inside the referenced volume instead of its root.
---@field readOnly? aws.batch.Boolean If this value is true, the container has read-only access to the volume. Otherwise, the container can write to the volume. The default value is false.

---@alias aws.batch.EksContainerVolumeMounts aws.batch.EksContainerVolumeMount[]

---@alias aws.batch.EksContainers aws.batch.EksContainer[]

