---An object that represents summary details of a job.
---@class aws.batch.JobSummary
---@field jobArn? aws.batch.String The Amazon Resource Name (ARN) of the job.
---@field jobId aws.batch.String The job ID.
---@field jobName aws.batch.String The job name.
